            instructions_en: "Attach a D-handle to each low pulley and stand in the middle of the cable crossover machine. Grasp the handles with a pronated grip, palms facing down, and step forward with your feet shoulder-width apart. Slightly bend your knees and hinge forward at the waist, keeping your back straight and your abs engaged. With your arms out to the sides and your elbows slightly bent, exhale as you squeeze your shoulder blades together and draw the cables back and upward in a reverse-fly motion. Pause briefly at peak contraction, then inhale and slowly return to the starting position. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.",
