            instructions_en: "Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart. Lower into a squat by bending your knees and pushing your hips back. Jump explosively off the floor, extending your hips, knees, and ankles. While airborne, quickly extend your arms forward for balance. Land softly on the balls of your feet and immediately move into the next repetition. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.",
