            instructions_en: "Lie on your back on the floor with your knees bent and feet flat. Hold a kettlebell in each hand with your palms facing your legs and your arms extended toward the ceiling. Lower one kettlebell toward your shoulder while keeping the other arm extended upward. Press the lowered kettlebell back to the starting position as you lower the other kettlebell toward its shoulder. Continue alternating presses for the desired number of repetitions.",
