            instructions_en: "Start in a push-up position with your hands slightly wider than shoulder-width apart and your feet together. Bring your right knee toward your right elbow without lifting it off the floor. As you move your right knee back, bend your elbows and lower your body toward the floor. Return to the starting position, then repeat with your left knee moving toward your left elbow. Continue alternating sides for the desired number of repetitions.",
