            instructions_en: "Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart, holding a medicine ball at chest height. Step forward with your right foot while pushing the medicine ball forward and fully extending your arms. Release the ball as you push it forward, allowing it to roll ahead. Quickly run forward and catch the ball before it hits the ground. Once you catch the ball, bring it back to your chest and repeat the movement with your left foot stepping forward. Continue alternating your lead leg for the desired number of repetitions.",
