            instructions_en: "Stand in front of a step or platform, holding a dumbbell in each hand with your palms facing your body. Place your right foot on the step, ensuring the entire sole is supported. Brace your core and drive through your right heel to step up, bringing your left knee toward your chest. At the top, perform a biceps curl by bending your elbows and bringing the dumbbells toward your shoulders. Lower the dumbbells and bring your left foot back down to the floor. Repeat on the other side, stepping up with your left foot and curling the dumbbells. Continue alternating sides for the desired number of reps.",
