            instructions_en: "Stand facing a cable machine with a straight bar positioned at chest height. Grasp the bar with an overhand grip and step back to create tension in the cable. Place your feet shoulder-width apart and bend your knees slightly. Keep your back straight and your core engaged throughout the exercise. Begin with your arm fully extended and perpendicular to the floor. Keeping your upper arm still, exhale and push the bar downward until your arm is fully straight. Pause briefly, then inhale and slowly return to the starting position. Complete the desired number of repetitions, then switch arms.",
