            instructions_en: "Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart, holding the barbell in front of your thighs with an overhand grip. Shift your weight onto your left leg and lift your right foot slightly off the floor. Hinge forward at your hips, keeping your back straight and extending your right leg behind you for balance. Lower the barbell toward the floor, keeping it close to your body and your left knee slightly bent. Pause briefly at the bottom, then engage your glutes and hamstrings to raise your torso back to the starting position. Complete the desired number of repetitions, then switch sides.",
