            instructions_en: "Lie on a bench with your feet flat on the floor and your back against the bench. Grasp the barbell with a reverse (underhand) grip, hands shoulder-width apart. Unrack the barbell and hold it directly above your chest with your arms fully extended. Slowly lower the barbell toward your chest, keeping your elbows close to your body. Pause briefly when the barbell is just above your chest. Press the barbell back to the starting position, fully extending your arms. Repeat for the required number of repetitions.",
