            instructions_en: "Lie on your back with your legs extended and your arms at your sides. Place your hands under your glutes for support. Engage your abs and lift both legs off the floor, keeping them straight. As you raise your legs, rotate your hips to one side, moving your legs toward the opposite shoulder. Pause briefly at the top, then slowly lower your legs to the starting position. Repeat, rotating your hips to the other side this time. Continue alternating sides for the desired number of repetitions.",
