            instructions_en: "Position yourself in a captain's chair with your back against the backrest and your forearms on the arm pads. Keep your upper body stable and your back straight. Engage your abs and raise your legs in front of you, keeping them straight. Continue lifting until your legs are parallel to the floor or as high as you can comfortably raise them. Pause briefly at the top, then slowly lower your legs to the starting position. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.",
