            instructions_en: "Lie on a bench with your head at one end and your feet planted on the floor. Hold an EZ bar with a pronated grip (palms facing away from you), hands shoulder-width apart. Extend your arms directly above your chest, maintaining a slight bend in your elbows. Lower the bar in an arc behind your head, maintaining the slight bend in your elbows. Pause briefly, then reverse the arc to bring the bar back to the starting position. Repeat for the prescribed number of repetitions.",
