            instructions_en: "Secure the resistance band to a sturdy overhead anchor. Stand facing the anchor with your feet shoulder-width apart. Grasp the band with an underhand grip, with your hands slightly wider than shoulder-width apart. Step back to create tension in the band, keeping your arms fully extended. Brace your core and squeeze your shoulder blades together. Pull the band down toward your chest, leading with your elbows. Pause briefly at the bottom of the movement, feeling your lats contract. Slowly release the tension in the band and return to the starting position. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.",
