            instructions_en: "Secure the resistance band to a fixed overhead anchor, such as a pull-up bar or sturdy beam. Sit on a bench or chair facing the band, with your feet flat on the floor and your knees bent. Grip the band firmly with your palms facing you. Keep your back straight and engage your core. Pull the band down toward your chest, squeezing your shoulder blades together. Pause briefly at the bottom of the movement, feeling your lats contract. Slowly let the band return to the starting position, maintaining control throughout the movement. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.",
