            instructions_en: "Start in a high plank with your hands slightly wider than shoulder-width apart and your body in a straight line. Lower your body toward the floor by bending your elbows and keeping them close to your sides. As you lower, tap your chest with your right hand. Return to the starting position. Repeat the movement, this time tapping your chest with your left hand. Continue alternating sides for the desired number of repetitions.",
