            instructions_en: "Support yourself between two parallel bars with your arms fully extended and your body suspended above the floor. Bend your knees and cross your ankles. Bend your elbows to lower your body until your upper arms are parallel to the floor. Pause briefly, then straighten your arms to return to the starting position. Repeat for the prescribed number of repetitions.",
