            instructions_en: "Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart. Bend your knees and push your hips back to lower your body as though sitting in a chair. Keep your chest lifted and your back straight. Lower until your thighs are parallel to the floor. Push through your heels to return to the starting position. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.",
