            instructions_en: "Attach a single handle to the high pulley of a cable machine. Stand facing the machine with your feet shoulder-width apart. Grasp the handle with an overhand grip and fully extend your arm. Keep your back straight and your core engaged. Pull the handle down toward your side, keeping your elbow close to your body. Pause briefly at the bottom, contracting your lats. Slowly allow the handle to return to the starting position. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions. Switch sides and repeat with your other arm.",
